<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Dancing in the Smoke - From the Netflix Series "Nobody Wants This" Season 2</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">GIVĒON</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Dancing in the Smoke (From the Netflix Series "Nobody Wants This" Season 2)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">4IMtvPPuBjtkWoMqlOwqYL</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.140" end="00:15.140">Hmm-mm, mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.000" end="00:22.420">Fourth time's a charm, or something like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.420" end="00:30.420">Bleach on my clothes, and pictures on fire, but I'm coming back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.540" end="00:38.350">Fourth time I called, are you calling back?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.350" end="00:46.250">Shattered windows, slashing my tires, but I'm coming back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.250" end="00:48.510">My hands, rest right on your back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.510" end="00:50.660">And yours on my shoulder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.660" end="00:52.480">Don't see eye to eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.480" end="00:57.560">But we're nose to nose tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.560" end="01:01.490">Just can't let you go, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.490" end="01:08.770">Everything's on fire, but I can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.770" end="01:15.950">We dance in the smoke, we dance in the smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.950" end="01:23.950">Said it, everything's on fire, but I can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.280" end="01:32.280">We dance in the smoke, we dance in the smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.740" end="01:39.930">Dancing with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.930" end="01:47.530">Dancing with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.530" end="01:55.280">Back and forth, my love, do you love me back? (Do you love me back?)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.280" end="02:03.280">Can't let it go, you and me both, can I have this dance? Mm</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.080" end="02:07.750">Took it too far and you know it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.750" end="02:11.560">Spray paint the car when you're hurting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.560" end="02:15.460">Even though everything's burning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.460" end="02:19.550">I want you to know it's all worth it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:19.550" end="02:21.300">My hands rest right on your back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:21.300" end="02:23.460">And yours on my shoulder</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:23.460" end="02:25.220">Don't see eye to eye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.220" end="02:29.170">But we're nose to nose tonight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.170" end="02:33.930">Just can't let you go, oh, oh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:33.930" end="02:41.690">Everything's on fire, but I can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.690" end="02:48.820">We dance in the smoke, we dance in the smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.820" end="02:56.820">Said it, everything's on fire, but I can't let you go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.150" end="03:05.130">We dance in the smoke, we dance in the smoke</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:05.130" end="03:12.720">Dancing with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:12.720" end="03:20.720">Dancing with you (dancing with you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:29.260" end="03:32.270">Oh, dancing with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:32.270" end="03:36.270" /></div></body></tt>